<title>USA: CVS Corp Q4 shr $0.53 vs loss $5.85.</title>
<headline>CVS Corp Q4 shr $0.53 vs loss $5.85.</headline>
<dateline>WOONSOCKET, R.I. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.53     loss	 $5.85</p>
<p> Net profit		60,064     loss     610,358</p>
<p> Revs		   1,549,892		1,363,993</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     106,401		  105,090</p>
<p>Year</p>
