<p> Revs		   5,528,110		4,865,025</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     105,726		  105,081</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: CVS 1996 Q4 oper profit $0.55 per share vs $0.79.</p>
<p>1996 Q4 and year operating results include gain from sale of TJX Cos Inc preferred stock of $0.11 and $0.68 per share, respectively.</p>
<p>1995 Q4 and year results include pre-tax restructuring charge of $165.6 million and other one-time charges of $11.5 million.</p>
